Package: iOrganoAssay
Type: Package
Title: iOrganoAssay Shiny Application for Mouse Intestinal Organoid Image Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Sung-Wook",
                  family = "Nam",
                  email = "nams@knu.ac.kr",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides an interactive Shiny application (iOrganoAssay) for
    the analysis of mouse intestinal organoid (mIO) microscopy images and
    their associated morphometric metrics. The application includes an
    Analysis tab for daily-based monitoring of organoid morphology and a
    Validation tab for evaluating segmentation quality using Dice score and
    related metrics. The package bundles the Shiny app inside R, so that
    users can launch it directly from R/RStudio without copying or pasting
    any script.
